{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1347,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841e4998bf087cd4bccef90e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我死党要搬家啦。毕竟是春天？\r\n也没办法？但我叫她做好心理准备，\r\n接受我的LANE贴图轰炸啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8a8aa373dead6c954916741c562cea5cfe13d83078183031cdbe009ec79f6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a300fb07d29dab5b0cedb206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕～真的选不出来！泳装和浴衣\r\n我都想要……等特卖或许有机会\r\n一次买？……啊～钱不够用啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c6c307730067b88c539cf1145b54af7d8b11b76ce38028ae3b47d7b7c9788a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb65c8865dd20381155e286a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你啊，看了一堆跟我有关的\r\n比赛用书？对吧？你整年\r\n都在过阅读之秋喔……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbdc463e1477163463eef4b9497f027f5a6674244f96ed3f4ee02b8cf696a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f98e89e1918991818ed53c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，冷死了……但我今天想穿\r\n露肩装耶……嗳，有没有什么\r\n暖暖的东西能喝？像是可可之类。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ce37fbb7f4cf0aa7bb8f86a2c43253d4554271908612b9d1e7fed1eb64f702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de0acf087f5ab2b22e87955",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4fa391e0db2eece02ef4a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f6999ddcd345daac9214871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船那家伙，每次见面都会\r\n缠着我说想和我跑一场。\r\n真的很想叫她别再这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cdce81924a4eb048806368e6d74163bbdef9314f3c4dfd94c332b1d3f0ed00b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd538fe08c0153999d5ca02d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我妹妹的个性比较低调，\r\n却说想要和我有一样的衣服，\r\n不觉得很可爱吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "408d90feee3f38bcbf95c5b8433afc5122fa152e9cf3c14dad9c2bdef4e82d5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de351b0d55cd7ffd6ce74cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贩卖部有在卖\r\n超好吃的葡萄！\r\n啊？也太神了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b57ea9c8cf18947109e8a07d28c6ca55189326410c81d3c461f1ff394576cde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac6d23cf7304ee539b170869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质明明很有实力，\r\n却总是很负面呢～\r\n……虽然也不是不能理解啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba27cd340117af0d24915afd3edc9719ebc3aa1fe557661b03037284961eff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:168c31bba2078510ed5b30a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奖券藏不会太容易感动了吗？\r\n只是给她巧克力就大哭，\r\n她的泪腺到底是怎么回事啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c39e52a9575dd9476ca3413da0d5692fdeb543d00af9689e1e65c9ce1ee33a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:051019c653fd17d78229d1cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉会随歌曲摇摆☆\r\n穿上这件，身体似乎就会\r\n擅自摆动，觉得不跳不行呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9f9149c09b9cbee59f8ce69671326ff7c63539fdd1ae595870b3e14e56712dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b473daee761d13c010583c01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别一直盯着看。\r\n不是站在舞台上，\r\n让人有点无法冷静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "837f5980cd271ada74be39d6720755cf96cef3d1046d0da47a84c759a5fa93d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73ce9f0362e199d1437f2aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟是认真设计的决胜服，\r\n这样竞赛时也能充满干劲啦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9ba8a6b567108ed45fbc7d84ee516df5e6a65620fdf83dd2084e9666e13e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6226e06937e169d6ca1b54a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想透过这件决胜服，\r\n展现出\r\n自己全力以赴的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31bc185b83333daffca1843961e0f0392541af9e1a0f7c118fe8017d49d3e35b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4c47f5ae4d0364ead0e7853",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做晨练？\r\n不能做假想训练就好吗？\r\n……啊，我有自信绝对会睡着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3e6f1e17a41654c041d36c66312063478d227383a02cd94679d2baed4d8251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29fc048d6cbe66b482fab5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道城市有没有空～\r\n问她要不要一起去吃饭吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa7305f0de0d51b5607d8cad44a99a5cdfc74a054f27217972507a5895b512d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72e4eabe40a3c032ead0ea45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕，已经这么晚了？\r\n在睡觉前，\r\n得做好美甲和保湿才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8380d32539d45ba9025914a0d651ddb509905e2e3faa1655016f88b272738ad5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad855ccb923584dae4f7fb86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咖啡厅经常会有樱花口味的东西，\r\n那个到底是什么的味道？\r\n吃下花瓣就会有那样的味道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69631191ef577b81b1cb7a180d4cd55059b1c12338e4616fe55c0112ad1aa44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1a1c11dc03bb7730ee9e97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好难决定浴衣的花色～！\r\n指甲也要配合整体造型，\r\n得仔细考虑才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69f6775a4ba852e82d54f8f49a2db1ee13f7047cbc4fedfa343c98a150f95d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe95b40f20663a6ef06e262a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃烧柴火后\r\n就冒出浓浓的烟。\r\n……身上应该没有烟臭味吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c0d2d8a229fbf3e61233eaa1b24e07345667741a28e19bd89011da92412634",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a8dcb1dcdf3bd2210d47196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴上手套的话，\r\n就会把美甲遮住了～\r\n唔～不过这样真的好冷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "29194a33c9dfbefe932b36073d557e35ea759a6c7b88b8fde5b1810dd62a19fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:accc39023c51f0bfe47e9a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，指甲伸出来一下。我找到\r\n以前在百元商店买的指甲油了。\r\n那时候我练得超勤呢。有够怀念啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cee7949f20c6f92efa12e7071e99751f433845799f9f162f1e564554191eaa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:556e856db430f6ebb092fc0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸他又～寄了运动服给我。\r\n穿起来很闷热又不舒服……\r\n吼唷，人家衣柜都要塞满了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc63eb41de4e9d061479bab9fb3e8726b0d5778093b09073ba502af1120c2e3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486b40f0a5b9412ba0880bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天哪！我推的品牌\r\n用城市当海报人物了！\r\n哗……总之那件外套我先买了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce64feb171b14148d21b687b9ea5edb21ec52fbc4d41c090b7cd8d35318efc21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b89e794aef6759d0250074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信她啊，连汉堡也超级会吃的耶！\r\n不觉得很扯吗～？\r\n我刚刚想学怎么吃，结果爆难的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "740ce9ba3a0d4f2989e334188e855fa42c6d42f08c4c81f443a19b142feb8d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f409e11f9214dc2d3db9555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去圣代快吃比赛～结果看到太阳\r\n带了把杓子过来！虽然画面看起来\r\n很扯，不过很方便吃耶！超好笑啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "591e18497b093b0a528349f44412b4fad6558258b8ceb592212e99802190ed13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b28f2d867d239221986bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上我擦指甲油的时候，奖券藏的\r\n眼神盯得我整个人没办法专心……\r\n算啦，下次我顺便帮她擦吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57c68db8e011dee59b18794683b7ad9d2c4c9741e827e5747fc9a30cdd38228",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df4edd89e4cc19f0bef70c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗅嗅……顺便跟你说，这罐护发油\r\n和城市是同款的哦～！麝香的味道\r\n闻起来真的很棒呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9133f6d3cb6d7b57d30f35cbd89d86eae76c44b5bd1f18ca37dde7e07d6625d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd38a9fff4bb339bac264ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说啊，不知道为什么我收到了\r\n看起来很贵的烤肉的优惠券耶。\r\n那不就是要我去吃夜宵了吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bb76cb9afaa3ccf6fbc1fc076308319b883777fa502dd23647bbc164b17244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb830450cc900f31c39e55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船追着我大喊什么「我要拿你\r\n来赏花啦」！这套不过就只是\r\n粉红色而已，又不是樱花！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "525a96d88c46754ab0b9107a443d290e5b99ec0a581366193a6bc4c7fecc3165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14af556b4bfde1093948e202",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游泳池跟海边的感觉就是不一样！\r\n轮流去玩也很可以！\r\n然后再来狂拍一大堆影片吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab9d531ee174dc67d8ca4a220d3206e13b9a14e96d42e5333b84e478505776a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284b7c63ca4730a0575462bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天也有一大票祭典，真假？\r\n好想吃摊贩的小吃～！\r\n肚子会很难受～但我就想吃～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b53181efeb3dc96da7510c94a85557e628efb1b478252dd7a85c350173d06a51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd38f2213682685c84a4ec8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也得完全称霸灯饰才行呢～！\r\n像是照亮花海的灯光之类的啊～\r\n根本超赞的吧！我好期待～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c8bb8d103632338de2136af839240d9f3d3c9c93e95ee34bf7256757070e8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5f7964c9cd7f6d6ea1f30f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来觉得甜美系穿搭不适合我……\r\n结果好像还算挺上相的？真不愧是\r\n城市！……然后我也很有一套呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18e27736b14ccb99502043f09e8d37e4dccf6b6795cc57f5d16f9287827ef80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b74eceb61e16339f24c92d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后面的蝴蝶结有没有松掉？\r\n这很容易松脱啊～你的手很巧，\r\n教我怎么绑才不会掉嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3923e26a89b4fe43ac3a85686f71ce58d68a702dc78e597dffe96a87274a8474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172686b9bd9d1578b4276665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所以，今天要做什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8260b91169e877bd6741f8cbd7df7bad5349a0f0fc1f1981c0051abb4c468b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d640516fe3ae7e453adc5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うっし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1cf88129b28881b3a3997c345585c02ed377abee0e2ce5ab98b70370bcadda3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94297069ceaca705eae2701c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，今天是推出新色的日子！\r\n等训练结束后，\r\n就去趟美甲店吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "90d2f740121d81b659d647c110e6ecd0db9cf092e92a4600118e3522227e3f64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd7c43a7504afd858cc1c1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就开始吧。\r\n至少会完成你交代的事，\r\n你就好好看着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfc41246f4ff635d2608acc8d67cb5698235fc0af07aedab1599b3ee75cf116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb7cf67d92e81edffb840c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，要开始了吗？\r\n我的指甲也很完美，\r\n做好万全准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9899a053a933af5e3fe18d29e0ffc6d939c3f398d434731b6b07a485d48261cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee60fab9acd278ec69109840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起训练\r\n算是挺开心的。\r\n……好了，快点开始啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99f3b36c0067e9ec91912b636a09e89893cd8c2c27733d80eb5a3262b73ef31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6397b8ac29e4ff867b69111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对训练没有什么不安。\r\n毕竟你是专业的吧？这就是\r\n所谓的那个嘛，信赖？之类的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9b34bfd3285748ce1c85c595455c10426f7ed8b0d8444018d3cba25283683b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b021ac43a714495cbf4655dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是用我的照片设成手机的\r\n待机画面，就能超有干劲……\r\n不，别当真啦，我开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12d87d8100fec06799e3e18903e22940f48f5d64921a306b4fec512b11242a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:640e113457bed27338c94eb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎能靠夏季集训\r\n好好锻练……唔，糟糕！\r\n应该没有忘记带防晒吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a9efabd82d60f3ea743a264bb17fa27ce87ed6a85e34168c216768c880b398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ece328b46ad56ac62600ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点训练吧～对了，我今天\r\n要吃圣代，所以严格一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1abd5cbc198051ebfcdb3172b8b18fbd99ad7078fa7406b2ee6ec8b8261cc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f202b169382264240d5b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿啰哈♪这套穿搭我真心超爱！\r\n会有加速效果哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3fcb82da672d422a2b2dcabff14c46332b92893fd21985994317e6553bd1430",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03ce68afd6f7fc5a0e1cfeef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是厚底鞋最强了吧～！\r\n战斗力都暴增啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e72b1ba56c5225996cfae62d59425c9bc63b0c564c206ac8da8627f0fc60a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc6cabdaff23fc0b2e400dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "城市最近超认真的耶……\r\n啊──！我也来训练吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da128ed30a70b89b59db5b208a28130e35489adc560753ef1801b28aa07d934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a90186cbce148c0b4c60b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是说既然要喝珍奶，\r\n还是认真训练后比较好喝嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f315df9468352d55c9772f5bcc25ead290ef7de4b289b50d464b171ab20da8da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7d79af1c61849ba20ef46a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天搞不好会很嗨哦～？\r\n毕竟我打扮得超漂亮……\r\n你的训练项目也挺OK的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeff671d6a2c9011b6c04e49396bcd859c2c44ee3b99f33bddd3dc1f5f8bb38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46f0707719153c285abb6b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会认真训练的，\r\n带我去车站前那家怀旧甜点店吧？\r\n拜托啦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8718c4219e5f58c5215ba6562a8bf9778f4d68492871d1ac18083ffca595b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca94b389ca06fd4e1f1cac30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能看中你当训练员，\r\n不觉得我很有眼光吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "798bf37780c7910729867feda24aa5131e82fb698e7dcde201153e8f12dda13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb5bd10f44df22ef2f29bb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就说我也可以办得到吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c990eba76b89c631249cfe29a824da632a75d6607d29d5f9b449de60879ab30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fda213bc0427fcd401daad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和你在一起，\r\n感觉好像去哪都会很爆笑耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e2779fda194ef25421e174be5d0bfc7c00fed69ab91fe3998c7021283929a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a523e77d81528075b9db5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次你想去哪里，\r\n我可以陪你去喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b33ef2621bca107f38ee17412b873f3171891e70d55dc8bf3fc7b86f33a4723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52949b77082f5e263a882518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欧耶──感觉不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8d369a20eec4787982a2f065c006d8b4e1930544dfa77944d6bd8370fb53af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1257bdacf4cf2a3db2831858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的会让人嗨起来呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "555b390bd67e19892532b555ac15132978d6959555d9dba5ba123e26524d5992",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5395efb36d4ce86b726280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是东瀛佐敦，多指教咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "65fe9026897ab4bb2ad73fe9e53f05cbc2344011452b16ea8938ddd7aa6bba44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd56ccfa88f0704e49333249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，会让你见识到\r\n我也是有点实力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e08b7b41a638fab3607b6cd37f7b0419070b8886d7986ec346e3e5bda7fea8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf1ce79d3ef43119dfdd18f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还顺便擦了指甲油呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3510e6d4997777b48c4b2bfa95c431435c307f660f9deeb91ae4503d7246423b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2bab8b6039ead9f8b7bf7da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不是太强啦？笑死。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea879c7b7323abcc6841d3daf5c7f84eace09fc9615c9ab218b849f4e40b867e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a526102604c7fc9fb60e248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用力嗨起来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a714bab0235145fca637d75ddeb68cee2326892534e53f450dc99b24845eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ed46f2e2b9a93347340abb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆嗨MAX突破破～\r\n我还会继续成长喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "420ca0aa1ca745834c11de1253e19bafe22c87030a7b8afa716c06fad0d9beac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2e7a1cc3708745c6061f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶，度假啰☆我们这些姐妹淘\r\n比盛夏的天气还火热吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "252ba21b557434f8074004ed0ee762d13ed37560c4ecaf4a01633a4ccda7431b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc12de7d97e050e6036860d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是东瀛佐敦──\r\n阿啰哈～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65a772f3844b4f9380c7d28671e9bb9b7fff03e6bded04ad3d2b6a97eeb89ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3723ea9dacd4a1baaa5ae0df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97749ddb19142b8bbccc7be8a5cbeabc55fb347d260493017679b91da43abbe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73ee7ebc372340887e03193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还记得那天吗——我们一起干掉那群\r\n最棒也最糟的笨蛋的那天。\r\n…自那之后，我们的故事才真正开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62c87ab285b3b08e9d9dcebacc4e12c62612f1da0902f426af0a666f1a8f0d9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42f41ff890ec85fc8a2303b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f06e9d5d4b590fa75db11b1c2431f76a413069b4adaae557632a142ae95ad45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883b392f3d1834f2a222ac53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16631fc6a4d89079e1413ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是你在我心中重新点燃了火焰，让我\r\n将生命燃尽一般地活下去、活下去…\r\n既然如此，就狂奔到身死之日吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "212601ec99e4332b45cc70985a3ed0f91649817f35b7001261398c227127726f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7101ba129319e0ee96a88451",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在算是更加堕落了呢，还是略有\r\n起色了呢。反正不管怎么说……你也\r\n已经身处“这边”了。祝你好运吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b7cb6600eacbbb34d6adf16127a7c4e94d97b1fb01ed137bb3e782bdea2056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711a1ab5e65c2dc105f4fc47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年出游呢。要是有能让我寒毛卓竖\r\n的对手在的话倒是无所谓……\r\n你可做好觉悟了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c397d7a5a28fc39253714529f81daabea87ca92076dc96110c7dd31eb12afa88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4753aaaec8566558b47fb9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你准备了有趣的巧克力哦。你会\r\n尝到『中奖』的味道还是『没中』的\r\n味道呢…来啊，你该不会想逃了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "579eabfb02afa4f5565e702d888155b5b4b2fc774e87922d6f36643dde93b975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc431e0684b15a94735f207f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不喜欢甜兮兮的点心，帮我准备点\r\n苦味的吧。这份苦涩亦是精神的食粮\r\n……也就是，人生的味道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcc62796037cdca5bb5abd4ae0d241eb3c31b1cc273b79c65ec85d3ee0a0957",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307583e7bf510e0b2e086777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "织女与牛郎的故事虽是悲剧没错……\r\n不过我对这种老老实实地遵守\r\n无趣规则的故事还是喜欢不起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9de2979a103b419b4f3cb0531b48e08bcca446e08db61844fdcb32baa64015",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9423c7f82267648c547cdf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对付恶作剧的对策已经万全。\r\n柿种花生、鱿鱼干、醋乌贼……\r\n有了这些，我可谓坚如磐石啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "198d5303e8fa4fd122fafe059ffee59cf5e9890c740a298060e35789e3387156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a22290f763eb5f3e32e429a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那帮小鬼的礼物已经寄回去了……\r\n只要假扮圣诞老人的老爹\r\n别露馅就行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7665f8df741af0d10021b22f4fa32e36f2c08f13d69edebb411cada095acbe7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1619d1d61185069baf13aa4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪儿都在庆祝圣诞节，热闹得很啊。\r\n真没办法啊……\r\n去找个安静的藏身之地吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b472808d5a88398be75d9725cce856e21e5d43092b4e39c7a21dc36cd885062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba14220f33b55c8299d89da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场让人热血沸腾的决斗啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72835c45b41dcb61bb12a2d1f267f27b5f81083a6c25ae054ba0f76b6520cb11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
